    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You have become something beyond human - a ghost, a myth, a phantom that enemies never see coming twice.</p><p>The <strong>first Strike you make each turn</strong> while Tactical Cloak is active is a <strong>critical hit</strong> if it hits. You can use Hunter's Mark as a <strong>free action</strong>. Phantom Protocol now triggers on any kill, not just once per encounter.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Death From Above. Classes: Infiltrator.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: a hit with your first cloaked Strike each turn is raised to a critical hit when you roll it, and an \"Apex Infiltrator: used this turn\" effect then marks it as spent until your next turn.</em></p>"
    },
